---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CallToAction from '../components/CallToAction.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import charityPortrait from '../assets/charity/charity-headshot-leaning-in.jpg';
import charityHomePhoto from '../assets/charity/charity-headshot-sitting.jpg';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Charity Menefee | Wichita Area Realtor"
  description="Meet Charity Menefee, a patient and approachable Wichita-area Realtor with deep Kansas roots and a low-pressure way of working."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="About Charity"
    title="A real person to call when real estate gets complicated."
    intro="I was raised in Sharon Springs and have called Valley Center home for the past 20 years. I bring a calm, grounded, no-pressure approach to working with buyers and sellers."
  />

  <section class="about-story section-space" aria-labelledby="about-story-title">
    <div class="shell about-story-grid">
      <div class="about-portrait-wrap" data-reveal="left-scale">
        <Picture src={charityPortrait} formats={['avif', 'webp']} widths={[480, 720, 960]} sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 42vw, 100vw" alt="Portrait of Charity Menefee in a warm home interior" />
        <span>Charity Menefee</span>
      </div>
      <div class="about-story-copy prose" data-reveal="right">
        <p class="eyebrow">Small Town Roots</p>
        <h2 id="about-story-title">Small-town roots shaped a steady, grounded approach.</h2>
        <p>I grew up in Sharon Springs, Kansas, in the kind of small farm town where everybody knows everybody. My graduating class had just 20 people, and that experience shaped a lot about who I am: steady, grounded, and easy-going.</p>
        <p>I don’t believe in rushing big decisions or talking people into something that isn’t right for them. I’m a calm, no-pressure person by nature, and that carries over into how I work with buyers and sellers.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-approach section-space section-surface" aria-labelledby="about-approach-title">
    <div class="shell about-approach-grid">
      <div class="about-approach-copy" data-reveal="left">
        <p class="eyebrow">Family</p>
        <h2 id="about-approach-title">Valley Center is home.</h2>
        <p>My husband and I have been married for more than 20 years, and we’ve lived in Valley Center, Kansas, for the last 20 years. This community is home, not just a market I work in. I’ve watched the area grow and change, and I love helping people understand their options when they’re deciding where and what they want to buy.</p>
        <p>At home, life is busy (and fun). We have two teenage daughters, a Shih Tzu named Charlie, and, thanks to one of our daughters, a bearded dragon who has definitely become part of the family.</p>
        <p>When we’re not running around with school and activities, we like to camp and get outside whenever we can. I’m a big fan of simple plans, fresh air, and time that doesn’t feel scheduled down to the minute.</p>
      </div>
      <Picture class="about-home-photo" src={charityHomePhoto} formats={['avif', 'webp']} widths={[480, 720, 1080]} sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 48vw, 100vw" alt="Charity Menefee seated comfortably in a warm home interior" data-reveal="right" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-space" aria-labelledby="working-style-title">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-heading split-heading"><div data-reveal="left"><p class="eyebrow">Working together</p><h2 id="working-style-title">What the conversation can feel like.</h2></div><p data-reveal="right">Calm does not mean passive. It means giving the right details attention while keeping the process human.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-list reveal-stagger">
        <article data-reveal="up"><span>Listen</span><h3>Your plans come first</h3><p>Start with the questions, constraints, and hopes that are actually shaping your move.</p></article>
        <article data-reveal="up"><span>Explain</span><h3>No need to know the jargon</h3><p>Work through unfamiliar steps in plain language and ask what you need to ask.</p></article>
        <article data-reveal="up"><span>Proceed</span><h3>Move with intention</h3><p>Take the next step because it makes sense, not because someone manufactured urgency.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CallToAction title="Would my approach feel right for you?" />
</BaseLayout>
